HashiCorp Nomad and the cystemd agent
-------------------------------------

The `cystemd` agent (built from agent/) and the `cystemd-driver-systemd`
plugin (built from driver/) are built from HashiCorp Nomad, Copyright IBM
Corp., licensed under the Business Source License 1.1
(https://github.com/hashicorp/nomad/blob/main/LICENSE). Those binaries, and
the files under fork/nomad (an overlay and patches that modify Nomad), are
subject to that license. See docs/FORK.md.

`cystemd-server` and `cystemdctl` contain no Nomad code: they use HashiCorp's
API clients for Nomad, Consul and Vault (github.com/hashicorp/nomad/api,
github.com/hashicorp/consul/api, github.com/hashicorp/vault/api), licensed
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, whose source is available from those
repositories. internal/licensecheck enforces the boundary.


